  27:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            
  28:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface manages CPU AHB I-Code and D-Code accesses 
  29:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****        to the Flash memory. It implements the erase and program Flash memory operations 
  30:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****        and the read and write protection mechanisms.
  31:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       
  32:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface accelerates code execution with a system of instruction
