  36:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory read operations
  37:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory program/erase operations
