  46:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]                             
  47:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       This driver provides functions and macros to configure and program the FLASH 
  48:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       memory of all STM32F2xx devices.
  49:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****     
  50:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory IO Programming functions: 
  51:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and 
  52:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
  53:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Program functions: byte, half word, word and double word
  54:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) There Two modes of programming :
  55:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Polling mode using HAL_FLASH_Program() function
  56:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Interrupt mode using HAL_FLASH_Program_IT() function
  57:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****     
  58:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Interrupts and flags management functions : 
  59:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Handle FLASH interrupts by calling HAL_FLASH_IRQHandler()
  60:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Wait for last FLASH operation according to its status
  61:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Get error flag status by calling HAL_SetErrorCode()          
